{"unit_id":"zyd232__dsh-compaction-policy#card-zh","repo":"zyd232/dsh-compaction-policy","commit":"8fcd2e68793c5c44b4b9bcd030a2f4ddd846c06c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-policy 是一款 DSH Web 插件，可按 provider 或具体模型调整自动上下文压缩的触发时机。它在每次 agent 步骤前包装 preset 中的 compaction 引擎，只延后低于自定义阈值的自动压力检查；达到阈值后仍交给 DSH 原逻辑处理。设置面板可配置启用状态、路由范围、触发比例和输出预留，并支持恢复默认值。适合上下文窗口较小、压缩过早的模型使用；无需 API 密钥或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:117-155","lib/client.js:332-363"]}
{"unit_id":"zyd232__dsh-compaction-policy#card-en","repo":"zyd232/dsh-compaction-policy","commit":"8fcd2e68793c5c44b4b9bcd030a2f4ddd846c06c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Web plugin for setting automatic compaction thresholds by provider or model. It wraps the preset engine, skipping pressure checks below the threshold and delegating compaction to DSH when reached. Settings control routes, ratio, output reserve, and enablement. No API key or account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:117-155","lib/client.js:332-363"]}
